      "body": "Closes the test-oracle gap in #7071 (follow-on from triage task 13717; queue task 14350, lane code-l).\n\n## What\n\n- **New scenarios** `pkgs/id/tests/delegation_voiding_scenarios.rs` — groups-fold scenarios that actually reach `Engine::void` (`pkgs/id/src/groups/delegation.rs`): a grant is issued, its grantor is removed concurrently (neither event in the other's causal past), and the grantee's onward operation is judged at a position that has seen both.\n  - Strong remove: grant void, onward operation refused (`NoChain`).\n  - Weak remove: grant stands, onward operation applies.\n  - Causal-past control: a removal that has *seen* the grant does not void it (its `KeepPrior` mode retains it), even under strong remove.\n  - The group's delegation mode is `KeepPrior`, so no other disposition can cut the concurrent grant — `Engine::void` alone decides.\n- **Third planted mutation** `pkgs/id/tests/planted/delegation-voiding.patch` — inverts the strong-removal gate at `Engine::void`; wired into `planted-bug-check.sh` (mutated-files list, baseline, and a `delegation-voiding` check).\n- **README + script plant-history** — the \"open gap\" note is removed now that the gap is covered.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo test --test delegation_voiding_scenarios` — 3/3 pass unmutated; with the mutation planted, the strong/weak scenarios fail (mutation caught).\n- `pkgs/id/tests/planted-bug-check.sh` — exit 0: baseline green (including the new suite), all three planted bugs caught (`voiding-authority`, `frontier-mapping`, `delegation-voiding`).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796806768&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8014&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8014&signature=610ff34e3b7a2a35db8e894279a160c25ddb57e6c0f654a4b612d9a4ac1ae864\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8014?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
